PRODUCT BROWSING AND SORTING


| Field | Details |
|-------|---------|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_001 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_001 |
| Title | Verify that products are displayed with names, descriptions and prices |
| Preconditions | SauceDemo is accessible, and the user is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Username: `standard_user`; Password: `secret_sauce` |
| Test Steps | 1. View the Products page<br>2. Inspect the displayed product listings<br>3. Check that each product has a name, description and price |
| Expected Result | Each displayed product has a visible name, description and price. |


| Field | Details |
|-------|---------|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_002 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_002 |
| Title | Verify that products can be sorted by price in ascending and descending order |
| Preconditions | User is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Sort options: Price (low to high), Price (high to low) |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate the sorting dropdown on the Products page<br>2. Select Price (low to high)<br>3. Check the displayed product prices from top to bottom<br>4. Select Price (high to low)<br>5. Check the displayed product prices again |
| Expected Result | Low to high: Prices appear in ascending order, from cheapest to most expensive.<br>High to low:** Prices appear in descending order, from most expensive to cheapest. |


| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC_PRODUCT_003 |
| Linked Scenario | TS_PRODUCT_003 |
| Title | Verify that products can be sorted alphabetically by name from A to Z and Z to A |
| Preconditions | SauceDemo is accessible, and the user is logged in and viewing the Products page |
| Test Data | Sort options: Name (A to Z), Name (Z to A) |
| Test Steps | 1. Locate the sorting dropdown.<br>2. Select Name (A to Z).<br>3. Check the displayed product names from top to bottom.<br>4. Select Name (Z to A).<br>5. Check the displayed product names again. |
| Expected Result | Products are displayed alphabetically in ascending order (A to Z) and descending order (Z to A), according to the selected sorting option. |

